  "video_link": "",
  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Dominate the sun and great outdoors with our Boonie Hat! These military sun hats are made to government specifications, and provide 360-degree defense from the sun. With a wide, structured brim, these military boonies shade your neck and face, keeping you cool. These military hats are great for playing a few rounds of airsoft, along with hunting, camping, hiking, fishing, and other outdoor activities!</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "37075",
  "description": "<p>Dominate the sun and great outdoors with our Boonie Hat! These military sun hats are made to government specifications, and provide 360-degree defense from the sun. With a wide, structured brim, these military boonies shade your neck and face, keeping you cool. These military hats are great for playing a few rounds of airsoft, along with hunting, camping, hiking, fishing, and other outdoor activities!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Tough and Long-Lasting Materials:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Go ahead and wear your boonie bucket hat without a worry! Constructed from a durable 55% cotton / 45% polyester blend, these bucket hats easily withstand consistent outdoor use and sun exposure while providing a comfortable fit and feel.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Tactical Utility:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Each outdoor boonie hat features branch loops that are woven into and around the crown, allowing you to camouflage with surrounding vegetation and foliage, such as small branches, leaves, and plants. This feature is ideal for hunting and bird watching.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Designed with Comfort in Mind:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These tactical bucket hats also feature 4 screen side vents that cool you down by circulating hot or humid air away from your head. The adjustable chin strap ensures the boonie stays in place during a windy day or when you&rsquo;re on-the-go.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>We&rsquo;ve Got You Covered:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Complete your look with either an Uncle Milty Travel Vest or a Deluxe Safari Outback Vest, along with a pair of our BDU cargo pants or shorts.</li>\n</ul>",
